{"parse": {"title": "BBT-04", "pageid": 88292, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-03\" title=\"BBT-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">BBT-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-05\" title=\"BBT-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">BBT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.8A.E8.88.B9.EF.BC.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"上船！\">上船！</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 上船！</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">All Aboard!</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>船<span class=\"color-value\"></span>长<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>就<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>船<span class=\"color-value\"></span>员<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>但<span class=\"color-value\"></span>未<span class=\"color-value\"></span>必<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>船<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192004</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"waijiejiedao\"><img alt=\"waijiejiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/600px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/900px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/1200px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旅店里不少人跑了出来，人来人往，比她来时还要热闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>临时停电，船长，就像海上遇到的某些小型热带风暴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>来得很快，散得也很快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这里的电路已经脆弱到连一台唱片机和音响都容不下了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某认为停电和我们没有关系，警卫在电闸附近拉起了警戒线，也许是谁对它做了恶作剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这地方还真奇怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗摘下墨镜，环顾四周——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鬼鬼祟祟的年轻人徘徊在街道对面，交头接耳讨论着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>能听清他们在说什么吗，APPLe先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某只能听清“启明会”这个词……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>启明会？莱莉也提到过，这又是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个属于陌生时代的陌生名词，让摇滚海盗有些摸不着头脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻人：</div><div>不是我们干的！你们这是在污蔑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>听着先生，无论是不是，你们都要和我们走一趟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻人：</div><div>理由呢！我们只是住在这里，就要被你们拉去蹲大牢？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>街道的对面，警卫将几名年轻人团团围住，每个人的眼睛都死死地盯着对方。风吹过街道，将法令告示吹得哗啦啦响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>我们已经怀疑你们很久了，根据自治法令修正案，你们涉嫌参与非法的摇滚乐集会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>什么？我听到了不能不参与的话题，什么叫“非法”摇滚乐集会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>请等一下，船长……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>聚集在门前的人群不知何时停下了声音，警卫们黑色的制服将远方的街道和旅馆隔开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>在这里发生冲突并不是一个明智的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>但非法摇滚乐……好吧，起码不会是在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>街对面的气氛越来越紧张，直到一位穿着考究的先生走近，在警卫身边说了些什么。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警卫松开了手中的棍棒，年轻人垂下了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>您放心，我们只是，例行检查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>先生，就像议员大人说的，请和我们走一趟吧，很快就会结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-627520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻人：</div><div>……该死的，别碰我，我自己能走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骚乱逐渐远去，不多久后，那位先生又穿过马路，朝她这儿走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>啊，有福的小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>我是启明会的约翰尼，今晚在广播剧院，我们有一场聚会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>也许您愿意赏脸来咱们这儿看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绅士递来一张字迹优雅的手写信，点染着色彩诡怪的黑色墨水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这是什么？颂赞歌会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>是的，星期天的例行活动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>颂赞谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摘下墨镜，凑近信纸，缓缓念出那个古怪的单词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>“受苦者”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>是的，受苦者。为了祂，我们聚在一块儿，唱歌、吃饼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>就是一群人聚在一起昂着脑袋唱歌？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>像维尔汀和维尔汀的小跟班在学校里做的事那样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我可不会参加那种没意思的聚会哇！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>老兄，我们对这个没有兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>是吗？那真叫人遗憾，亲爱的神秘学家……同胞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>如果你回心转意，随时可以来找我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>戴礼帽的先生意味深长地看向漂浮半空的苹果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>我们欢迎每一位神秘学家同胞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>APPLe先生，您一定是刚来淘金镇，可别忘了向当局登记自己的身份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>在淘金镇，请做一位遵纪守法的好公民。如果您需要帮助，可以来剧院找我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绅士约翰尼：</div><div>启明会欢迎每一位神秘学家同胞，欢迎加入我们的周末聚会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他深鞠一躬，杵着手杖离开，脚步蹒跚地走向街口旁的小巷深处，警卫开始散去，街角恢复了往日的光景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>他好像个卖糖果的怪先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>启明会？他就是那个“议员大人”？也许维尔汀和基金会的家伙们会对这个感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你认识他们吗，APPLe先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某对这个组织一无所知，船长。很抱歉不能帮上你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>既然是议员，这些奇怪的禁令就是他发起的吧。嗯，启明会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>嘿，星锑——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马路对面，一位眼熟的女士朝她挥手打招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女士穿过道路，几步跑近她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>这就是你之前说的“苹果朋友”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>您好，APPLe某很高兴见到您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>你好，苹果先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她似乎憋着笑——一本正经地对一颗苹果打招呼，这就像《八点早报》里登载的荒唐故事一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你晕倒之后，莱莉开车载着我俩来了淘金镇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>当时差点儿就要用上十四行诗给的软盘呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>很感谢您救了APPLe某和船长，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>她刚才说的软盘是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>噢，便携神秘术软盘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>用这玩意儿不会违反《公共区域安全法》。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>虽然我也不知道这个安全法到底写了些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>大致来说，是使用神秘术需要在圣洛夫基金会登记许可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>否则会被视作“擅用神秘术”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>尽管这一法令……最近似乎都被人们忘掉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>APPLe先生补充着，但他的船长与新认识的女士都对此毫不在乎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>非必要不遵守规则，哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>如果触犯规则不会伤害任何人，也不会受到惩罚，那为什么还要被约束呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她嚼着巧克力，漫不经心地笑着说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>你看，没人管我们做啥——吃巧克力能有什么错呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>啊，你也是一个“破坏分子”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>一个？不，我们是一伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将巧克力糖球递给摇滚海盗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>你想入伙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>我们打算做点儿“有趣”的事情——给这座闷闷的小镇来点儿有趣的东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想法不谋而合，摇滚海盗当然不会错过这样的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>那就算我一个，伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哦呀，不对，应该是两个——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某当然会追随自己的船长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苹果先生在空中上下晃动，以示礼节——对一颗苹果来说，这已经足够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>很好，跟我来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "BBT-04"}}